  <div class="hint">Tap a symbol, then tap the map to mark one spot, or drag around several homes to mark an area. Tap the symbol again to move the map. Tap a placed symbol to move it (drag), change it or delete it. Each symbol gets a numbered note, which you describe in the next step. Locations stay on this device, but are included in the exported workbook.</div>
